{"candidateAnswer":"For drunken night rose incident","evidence":"[D25:2 | 9:37 pm on 11 January, 2024] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear about your health. It's tough when it gets in the way of life. You're being positive, but remember to take care of yourself too. By the way, I had to apologize to my partner for that drunken night, it was pretty embarrassing.","itemId":"urn:uuid:15e9b33e-bf98-5371-96fc-71c6811df5c2","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:baef45596c85eb97ca1100d485f6b3cd978c17c56b04d80c1b18afd5ef613d90","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Why did Evan apologize to his partner?","referenceAnswer":"for a drunken night","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"baef45596c85eb97ca1100d485f6b3cd978c17c56b04d80c1b18afd5ef613d90"}}]}